WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.423 --> 00:00:08.925
F.F., she's cutting in front of you.

00:00:09.926 --> 00:00:12.345
Hey, I said she cut in line.

00:00:12.429 --> 00:00:13.471
I know.

00:00:14.472 --> 00:00:15.473
For some reason,

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:18.727
I feel like the others
don't accept me here.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:20.812
It's like they're looking down on me.

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:23.314
Don't cut, dumbass!

00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:24.482
Tell her off.

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:26.526
I disagree with you.

00:00:27.235 --> 00:00:28.945
It's not good to force something.

00:00:29.779 --> 00:00:32.782
You have to change yourself
before seeking approval from others.

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:33.700
Isn't that right?

00:00:34.242 --> 00:00:38.121
So, I decided to do the exact opposite
of what I usually do.

00:00:39.497 --> 00:00:41.124
What's the opposite of coffee?

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:42.167
Tea?

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:46.755
That's right. Atroe's body,
which I took over, is craving coffee.

00:00:46.838 --> 00:00:48.339
So I go with tea instead.

00:00:48.923 --> 00:00:49.758
On purpose.

00:00:53.845 --> 00:00:54.804
Does that make sense?

00:00:57.265 --> 00:00:59.893
Instead of bread, I eat rice.

00:00:59.976 --> 00:01:03.772
Use my non-dominant left hand
instead of my right hand to eat.

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:07.275
I'm trying to change myself
by doing the exact opposite.

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.152
Listen, F.F.

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:11.696
The wound where I got shot…

00:01:12.697 --> 00:01:14.407
It hurts like hell.

00:01:14.491 --> 00:01:15.742
I told you.

00:01:15.825 --> 00:01:18.369
I can only fill the holes with plankton.

00:01:18.453 --> 00:01:21.122
The rest is up to
your body's ability to heal.

00:01:21.206 --> 00:01:22.749
-Got that?
-Damn.

00:01:24.167 --> 00:01:26.961
Jolyne, what's the opposite of pork?

00:01:27.045 --> 00:01:28.713
Maybe chicken, or even beef.

00:01:28.797 --> 00:01:31.216
The opposite of pork is salmon.

00:01:31.299 --> 00:01:33.301
Pigs lie around in mud all day.

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:36.221
Salmons swim against the current
to go upstream.

00:01:36.971 --> 00:01:38.181
I love that.

